A submarine!

345
00:21:41,180 --> 00:21:42,010
That's right.

346
00:21:42,200 --> 00:21:43,037
From here on out,

347
00:21:43,120 --> 00:21:49,060
we're riding to egypt in this you you've
got to be kidding how did you afford this?

348
