on the buzzer men by the
nile they got the money on a

351
00:22:21,900 --> 00:22:25,997
bed called crocodiles they
snap their teeth on your

352
00:22:26,080 --> 00:22:27,777
cigarette foreign types with

353
00:22:27,860 --> 00:22:29,217
a hookah walk

354
00:22:29,300 --> 00:22:36,300
like

355
00:22:37,140 --> 00:22:37,970
an egyptian

356
00:22:49,720 --> 00:22:53,937
the blonde waitresses take
their trays spin around and they

357
00:22:54,020 --> 00:22:58,117
cross the floor they've got
the moves you drop your drink

358
00:22:58,200 --> 00:23:01,937
then they bring you more all
the school kids so sick of books

359
