A submarine, huh?

365
00:23:26,960 --> 00:23:29,097
Perhaps a refreshing
white would be better?

366
00:23:29,180 --> 00:23:30,457
Hurry and make the coffee!

367
00:23:30,540 --> 00:23:31,757
